### Assignment example
POST http://localhost:3000/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"CAD","to":"USD","amount":100.00}

### Cross conversion (91.67 EUR)
POST http://localhost:3000/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"USD","to":"EUR","amount":100}

### Exact rounding at a tie (1.02 CAD)
POST http://localhost:3000/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"CAD","to":"CAD","amount":1.015}

### A token just above a tie (999999999999.99 CAD)
POST http://localhost:3000/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"CAD","to":"CAD","amount":999999999999.985000000001}

### Validation error (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"CAD","to":"BTC","amount":100}
